      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Pretty sure 90% of them (taken within the last hour) > /dev/null\n\nAnd Dolly-Cams \"take one pic every 10s-60s\" function aint cutting it either. Chances are the shot taken in that very moment turns out scuffed too. Hi Murphy! ;)\n\nHaving a photo taken every second would be lovely!",
