  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Automatically trigger a photo every 'user-selectable timeframe (~3-5 predefined values)' until manual stopping (or the storage-device is full [bursts])\n\nTLDR#2: So you dont have to cramp-grab the cam-UI while smashing the trigger every second just to end up with a scuffed \"hand in picture\"-pic. \n\nTrash/Keeper-Ratio: 75%|25%\n\nAttached a couple \"cam-grab-cramp\" jank-piXx - can add like 200 more if ya want me to! :P\n\nTHX <3",
